---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">About Our Calculator Suite</h1>
    <div class="prose mx-auto">
      <p>We provide free, easy-to-use online calculators to help you make informed financial and practical decisions. Our tools are designed with accuracy and usability in mind, giving you instant results without any sign-up or fees.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Our mission is to empower individuals with the tools they need to understand complex calculations, whether for personal finance, investments, retirement planning, or everyday conversions.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-4">Why Choose Our Calculators?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Accurate calculations based on industry-standard formulas</li>
        <li>Instant results with no page reloads</li>
        <li>Mobile-friendly design for use on any device</li>
        <li>Completely free with no hidden costs</li>
        <li>Privacy-focused - we don't collect or store your personal data</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-4">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>Have questions or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>